305
00:24:17.556 --> 00:24:19.557
He has never done
anything properly until today.

306
00:24:20.192 --> 00:24:21.325
Let's go, girls.

307
00:24:21.593 --> 00:24:22.726
Come on.

308
00:24:27.032 --> 00:24:28.132
Tsunami.
- Yes.

309
00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:31.202
