- Yes.

310
00:24:31.503 --> 00:24:33.037
Aunt.
- Yes.

311
00:24:33.271 --> 00:24:34.472
Which is my room?

312
00:24:35.574 --> 00:24:36.674
She is savita.

313
00:24:37.008 --> 00:24:38.242
She is here to cook food.

314
00:24:38.543 --> 00:24:41.312
Show her, her room.
- Yes, aunt.

315
00:24:44.115 --> 00:24:45.216
You?

316
