come.
...please don't get down.

364
00:27:39.691 --> 00:27:40.758
All clear, ma'am.

365
00:27:40.825 --> 00:27:42.693
Now you can kindly get down.

366
00:27:53.071 --> 00:27:54.271
Hi, divya.
- Hi.

367
00:27:54.372 --> 00:27:55.706
Hi, maya.
- Hi.

368
00:27:58.209 --> 00:27:59.309
Who lost his child?

369
