Ma'am, she is inside. She is busy.

400
00:29:27.365 --> 00:29:28.565
What are you doing outside?

401
00:29:28.633 --> 00:29:30.634
Go inside and stand
beside her. Go.

402
00:29:30.969 --> 00:29:32.603
How can i go inside,
ma'am? - What?

403
