407
00:29:42.714 --> 00:29:43.881
Thank you, ma'am.

408
00:29:45.650 --> 00:29:47.518
Meghna. Get down.

409
00:29:47.585 --> 00:29:48.752
Otherwise if it
breaks under the weight...

410
