Good morning, sir.

417
00:30:20.552 --> 00:30:22.152
Good morning. Good morning.
Please sit down.

418
00:30:25.957 --> 00:30:27.057
Sit down.

419
00:30:29.060 --> 00:30:30.227
Please sit down.

420
00:30:30.628 --> 00:30:31.695
Everybody sit...

421
